\"▲物防2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲物防2</font></span></span>]及[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲魔防2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲魔防2</font></span></span>]，所有效果持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>回合。自身还会获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"月廓成影\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">月廓成影</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"强力回击\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">强力回击</font></span></span>]，持续到下<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>次行动开始时。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-4 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/54/aepucshqtkja8ptie99s4adb8a6jsog.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-4_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/54/aepucshqtkja8ptie99s4adb8a6jsog.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%88%B1%E8%8E%8E\" title=\"角色图鉴库/爱莎\"><img alt=\"头像 爱莎.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/4b/avapqa2vuo6ernxve07pidnrhletzcc.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">